    "description": "The Telecom SIM Deactivation API enables service providers to deactivate existing SIM cards within their network efficiently. This operation is essential for managing customer accounts, ensuring that inactive or lost SIMs are promptly disabled, thus reducing potential misuse. Typical consumers of this API include telecom operators and customer service systems that need to maintain up-to-date user information. By facilitating the deactivation process, this API supports better resource management and enhances security across telecom services.",
